      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.5.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "¿Qué significa esto para una nueva situación? El conocimiento se vuelve portátil.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Estás en la orilla del arroyo. Antes de medir algo — ¿qué es lo primero que notas sobre el agua aquí en comparación con diez pies aguas arriba?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Es más lento aquí y hay más lodo en el fondo.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-08T02:37:22.153161+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "¿Buena observación? ¿Por qué crees que el lodo se depositó aquí y no aguas arriba donde el agua es más rápida?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "¿Puede que el agua más lenta no pueda llevar tanta carga?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Esa es la dirección correcta. ¿Qué podrías medir o fotografiar aquí para apoyar esa idea?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-08T02:37:44.624442+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
