      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The longer answer is that educational technology spent those years solving the wrong problem. EdTech iterated on the classroom — better LMS, better video, better quiz tools. It made the existing model more efficient. Peripateticware doesn\\'t try to make the classroom more efficient. It tries to replace the classroom, at least occasionally, with the world."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "La respuesta más larga es que la tecnología educativa pasó esos años resolviendo el problema equivocado. La EdTech iteró en el aula — mejores LMS, mejores videos, mejores herramientas de cuestionario. Hizo que el modelo existente fuera más eficiente. Peripateticware no intenta hacer el aula más eficiente. Intenta reemplazar la aula, al menos ocasionalmente, con el mundo.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-2026-07-08T03:31:47.422866+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-07-08T03:31:47.422866+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-08T03:31:47.422866+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s a harder sell. Schools are risk-averse. Outdoor learning has a liability optic. \"The world is your classroom\" sounds like a marketing line until you\\'ve watched a ten-year-old explain sediment transport to a crow-shaped AI guide while standing in a creek bed, and then read the field journal entry they wrote that afternoon, and understood that they understood."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That's harder to sell. Schools are risk-averse. Outdoor learning has liability implications. 'The world is your classroom' sounds like marketing until you've seen a ten-year-old explain sediment transport to an AI guide shaped like a crow while standing in a creek bed, and then read the field journal entry they wrote that afternoon, and understood that they understood.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-07-08T03:31:47.422866+00:00"
